{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.AntipodeIndependence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.AntipodeIndependence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations"],"declarations":29,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.id_eq_zero_of_antipode_sq_eq_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.id_eq_zero_of_antipode_sq_eq_id","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L200-L216","doc":"**The cost, part two.**  With zero morphisms available, `S ≫ S = 𝟙` as a\ntheorem would have forced `𝟙_A = 0` — every such object a zero object.\nTake `g = 0`: `0 ≫ 0 = 0`, so `0 = 𝟙`.\n\n🛑 **Scope.**  This argument substitutes `0` for the antipode and therefore\nneeds `antipode` to be *free data*.  It applies to\n`FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom` and **not** to the current\n`QOU.FrobeniusHopfData`, whose antipode is determined\n(`QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.antipode_unique`) and so cannot be chosen. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.endo_comm_of_antipode_sq_eq_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.endo_comm_of_antipode_sq_eq_id","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L191-L198","doc":"**The cost, part one.**  Under the pre-axiom reading, `S ≫ S = 𝟙` as a\ntheorem would have made every such endomorphism monoid commutative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.endo_comm_of_sq_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.endo_comm_of_sq_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L172-L189","doc":"A monoid in which every element squares to the identity is commutative,\nstated for the endomorphism monoid of an object of a category. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.involutive_of_sq_eq_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.involutive_of_sq_eq_id","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L154-L161","doc":"Had `S ≫ S = 𝟙` been derivable from the pre-axiom laws, **every**\nendomorphism of **every** such object would have been an involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.counit_property_vacuous","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.counit_property_vacuous","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L146-L152","doc":"The same for the counit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.unit_property_vacuous","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.unit_property_vacuous","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L138-L144","doc":"The same for the unit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.antipode_property_vacuous","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.antipode_property_vacuous","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L124-L136","doc":"**The antipode was unconstrained.**  If a property `P` of antipodes was\nprovable for every such structure, then it held of *every* endomorphism of\n*every* one of them.\n\nContrapositive, which is how this is read: to show a property of `S` was\n**not** derivable, it sufficed to exhibit one object with one endomorphism\nlacking it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withCounit_counit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withCounit_counit","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L119-L120","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withUnit_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withUnit_unit","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L116-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_comul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_comul","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L113-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_mul","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L110-L111","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_antipode","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_antipode","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L107-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode_obj","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L104-L105","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withCounit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withCounit","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L99-L102","doc":"Replace the counit by an arbitrary morphism `A ⟶ 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withUnit","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L94-L97","doc":"Replace the unit by an arbitrary morphism `𝟙 ⟶ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.withAntipode","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L87-L92","doc":"Replace the antipode by an arbitrary endomorphism.  Every law is\ndischarged by the *same* proof as in `F`, because no law mentions\n`antipode`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.frobenius_relation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.frobenius_relation","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Frobenius relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.pairing_snake_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.pairing_snake_right","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L76-L76","doc":"Snake identity (right). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.pairing_snake_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.pairing_snake_left","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L72-L72","doc":"Snake identity (left). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.coevaluation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.coevaluation","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L70-L70","doc":"Coevaluation `𝟙 ⟶ A ⊗ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.frobeniusForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.frobeniusForm","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Frobenius form `λ : A ⟶ 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.antipode","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.antipode","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Antipode `S : A ⟶ A`.  Constrained by no law below — the whole point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.counit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.counit","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Counit `ε : A ⟶ 𝟙`.  Constrained by no law below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.comul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.comul","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Comultiplication `Δ : A ⟶ A ⊗ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.unit","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Unit `η : 𝟙 ⟶ A`.  Constrained by no law below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.mul","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Multiplication `μ : A ⊗ A ⟶ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.obj","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The underlying object `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AntipodeIndependence.FrobeniusHopfDataPreAxiom","kind":"structure","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/AntipodeIndependence.lean#L47-L81","doc":"**The pre-2026-09-14 shape of `QOU.FrobeniusHopfData`**, reproduced so the\nindependence result below stays checkable after the live structure gained\nits algebra / coalgebra / antipode laws.\n\nEight data fields; three laws.  `unit`, `counit` and `antipode` occur in\nnone of the three. ","signatureChunk":0}]}